WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.428
Access decisions and spending 3 Diary access and protected

00:00:05.481 --> 00:00:11.231
information Daniel receives approved delegated access sufficient to coordinate

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:16.468
availability and business arrangements Private commitments may appear as

00:00:16.521 --> 00:00:21.323
unavailable periods without a personal explanation Where a private

00:00:21.389 --> 00:00:26.507
commitment affects agreed protective coverage the necessary operational information

00:00:26.586 --> 00:00:30.744
goes through the approved restricted route The existence of

00:00:30.744 --> 00:00:33.718
a protected block is not permission to investigate its

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:39.047
purpose or disclose its detail 4 Routine decision authority

00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:44.165
Daniel may arrange and move routine internal administrative meetings

00:00:44.205 --> 00:00:48.547
within agreed available periods when no protected commitment external

00:00:48.573 --> 00:00:53.981
undertaking cost or specialist dependency is affected Changes to

00:00:53.994 --> 00:00:58.942
executive decision meetings external visits or protected periods require

00:00:58.994 --> 00:01:03.968
the identified decision-maker's approval A request received directly by

00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:07.205
Lindiwe is entered into the controlled process before others

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:12.310
are told that consequential arrangements are complete 5 Spending

00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:17.468
and supplier authority In this fictional example only Daniel

00:01:17.481 --> 00:01:20.797
may place orders for pre-approved meeting consumables up to

00:01:20.863 --> 00:01:25.468
R2 000 per event within an already approved budget

00:01:25.521 --> 00:01:29.494
and supplier process He may not split purchases to

00:01:29.507 --> 00:01:33.744
avoid the limit He may prepare a quotation comparison

00:01:33.771 --> 00:01:36.310
for larger expenditure but may not approve it or

00:01:36.376 --> 00:01:40.639
release payment A change to supplier payment details goes

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:45.231
to finance through the approved independent verification route The

00:01:45.257 --> 00:01:48.402
executive's preference for a supplier does not remove these

00:01:48.455 --> 00:01:49.244
conditions
